WEBVTT

00:04:29.329 --> 00:04:30.663
I’ve ever done in my life.

00:04:30.829 --> 00:04:32.329
Everybody was stressing me out.

00:04:32.329 --> 00:04:34.079
Even one of my girlfriends was like,

00:04:34.079 --> 00:04:36.413
“Are you going to lose weight
for your wedding?”

00:04:36.538 --> 00:04:39.329
I was like, “No, but I’m going
to lose girlfriends.”

00:04:39.329 --> 00:04:42.329
(Laughter and applause)

00:04:42.371 --> 00:04:43.454
That’s right.

00:04:44.163 --> 00:04:47.329
Sometimes you got to let them know,

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:49.371
“Sorry, sis, you ain’t making the cut.”

00:04:49.371 --> 00:04:50.371
(Laughter)

00:04:51.746 --> 00:04:52.746
Everybody though,

00:04:52.746 --> 00:04:55.454
like, I went to where I picked out
my wedding dress.

00:04:55.496 --> 00:04:59.038
The people at the bridal shop said,
“You have to lose weight for the dress.

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:00.954
You have to lose weight for the dress.”